# Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 Model Directory

This directory will contain the Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 base model.

## Download Instructions

```bash
huggingface-cli download Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 \
    --local-dir models/qwen-image-edit-2511 \
    --local-dir-use-symlinks False
```

See the main [models/README.md](../README.md) for complete setup instructions.
